# IPC in Blender

Compact Incremental Potential Contact core for Geometry Nodes **IPC Solver**.

- Method: Li / Ferguson / Jiang / Zorin / Panozzo, SIGGRAPH 2020.
  Implicit Euler + IPC barrier on particle pairs and a ground plane.
- Not a git-subtree of https://github.com/ipc-sim/ipc-toolkit (Eigen / TBB / CCD).
- License: MIT (see LICENSE)
